{"4095820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sí Jefe", "steam_appid": 4095820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4780550], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use, combine, and take risks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use drugs to move faster, attack faster, and change the game's visual and musical style, but be careful! You can get intoxicated and die. If you mix substances, the visual style and the different music genres will blend in real time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/93523e20526566b73b1c253ffdcb453d.poster.avif?t=1785579386\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/93523e20526566b73b1c253ffdcb453d.webm?t=1785579386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/93523e20526566b73b1c253ffdcb453d.mp4?t=1785579386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chaotic and psychedelic visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enter the mind of a girl who uses substances to alter her world and live a chaotic and psychedelic experience combined with a retro pixel-art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/9e4622842fbe371492eb88d4583fb3bb.poster.avif?t=1785579386\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/9e4622842fbe371492eb88d4583fb3bb.webm?t=1785579386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/9e4622842fbe371492eb88d4583fb3bb.mp4?t=1785579386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A dangerous, streetwise Mexico</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore an open world with a day/night cycle, diverse activities to complete, and where each run will be different and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/c449c280d6dddd46946bd3cb85e34eb9.poster.avif?t=1785579386\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/c449c280d6dddd46946bd3cb85e34eb9.webm?t=1785579386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/c449c280d6dddd46946bd3cb85e34eb9.mp4?t=1785579386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your own deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize your gameplay with a diverse array of weapons, drugs, and passive abilities that can completely change the game's mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/1e0fb95d6850010e4a1279a8c6de1fd1.poster.avif?t=1785579386\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095820/extras/1e0fb95d6850010e4a1279a8c6de1fd1.webm?t=1785579386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use, combine, and take risks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragrap